@startuml decision_loop
' Défi Enedis - one recommendation cycle: accept, reject with reason, learning
' Render: java -jar ../tools/plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tpng decision_loop.puml

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  DividerBackgroundColor #EEF3F8
  DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
}

title One decision cycle - from event to recommendation, rejection and learning

participant "Event bus" as BUS #F3F4F6
participant "Engine (OR)" as ENG #DCE7F3
participant "LLM\nexplain" as LX #D9F2EC
actor "Crisis manager" as MGR #FAD9CF
participant "LLM\ntranslate" as LT #D9F2EC
participant "Validator" as VAL #FFEFC7
database "Active rules\n& config" as RULES #F3F4F6
database "Decision log" as LOG #F3F4F6
participant "Learning" as LRN #E9E4FB

== 1. Something happens ==
BUS -> ENG : new incident INC_042 (Muret, 120 customers, est. 4 h)
activate ENG
ENG -> ENG : warm start: insert INC_042 into previous plan (< 10 ms)
ENG -> ENG : local search on full objective (200–500 ms)
ENG -> ENG : counterfactuals: best alternative team, Δscore
ENG -> LX : plan + explanation facts (JSON)
deactivate ENG
LX -> LX : verbalise in French,\ncheck every number exists in the facts
LX -> MGR : "Équipe 7 → Muret : 120 clients, 25 min de route,\nfin de poste dans 6 h. Équipe 4 coûterait +410 clients·h."
ENG -> LOG : proposal + facts

== 2a. Manager accepts ==
MGR -> BUS : dispatch team 7 → INC_042
MGR -> LOG : accepted

== 2b. Manager rejects, with a reason ==
MGR -> LT : reject: "la route de Muret est inondée jusqu'à 18h"
LT -> LT : fact or preference? → fact (access)
LT -> VAL : {"type": "zone_inaccessible", "zone": "Muret", "until": "18:00"}
VAL -> VAL : zone exists · time valid ·\nsafety rules untouched
VAL -> ENG : re-solve with the modifier (dry run)
activate ENG
ENG -> VAL : new plan + cost of the rule: +320 clients·h (+2 %)
deactivate ENG
VAL -> MGR : "Compris : Muret inaccessible jusqu'à 18h.\nAppliquer ? (coût : +320 clients·h)"
MGR -> VAL : confirm
VAL -> RULES : store modifier (scope: this crisis, removable)
RULES -> ENG : constraints & weights updated
ENG -> LX : new plan + diff vs previous
LX -> MGR : "Équipe 7 reste sur Saint-Gaudens ;\nMuret repris par l'équipe 4 à 18h05."
MGR -> LOG : rejected + reason + modifier + chosen plan

== 3. Reality comes back ==
BUS -> ENG : repair done INC_031 - actual 6 h (estimated 4 h)
ENG -> LOG : outcome
LOG -> LRN : calibration: repairs run +30 % in this zone today
LRN -> ENG : corrected estimates for pending incidents → re-plan

== 4. Between crises: the system proposes improvements ==
LOG -> LRN : all decisions, reasons, chosen vs rejected plans
LRN -> LRN : rules from memory (same rejection ≥ 3 times)\npreference fit: β, λ from chosen vs rejected plans
LRN -> MGR : "Vous valorisez les clients sensibles ≈ 5× (14 décisions).\nAdopter β = 5 ?"
MGR -> RULES : approve → new config version (rollback possible)
@enduml
